    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1736">

                <pb facs="1109" n="993" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg993"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 718.1915/211.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The President of Costa Rica
                        to the President.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Translation.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">San José</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-09-13">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 13, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Costa Rica and my Government cordially applaud the award rendered by the
                    illustrious Chief Justice, and once more has the good fortune of settling its
                    boundary disputes through a decision dictated by the high sense of justice of
                    your great nation. Will your excellency please accept the expression of our
                    gratitude.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Alfredo Gonzalez</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
